%% Pencil and marker stroke preview then terminal commit sequence
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber

  actor User as User pointer
  participant Surface as CanvasSurface
  participant Tools as CanvasToolPort
  participant IE as InteractionEngine
  participant Preview as CanvasPreviewState
  participant Frame as FrameEngine
  participant EK as EditKernel
  participant Store as DocumentStoreKernel
  participant Draft as DraftDocument
  participant Touched as TouchedSet
  participant CC as CommitCompiler
  participant Effects as CommitEffects
  participant Applier as CommitApplier
  participant Spatial as SpatialKernel
  participant Projection as DocumentProjectionCache
  participant Events as EventBuffer
  participant Runtime as RuntimeRoot
  participant Signals as Public state/effects

  User->>Surface: pointer down in draw mode with pencil or marker
  Surface->>Tools: handlePointer(CanvasPointerSample down)
  Tools->>IE: normalized finite down sample
  IE->>IE: admit one active pointer token
  IE->>IE: read drawStyle and start pencil or marker stroke session
  Note over IE: Session stores pointer token, sessionId, tool, color, thickness, opacity, and normalized stroke points.
  IE->>Preview: publish CanvasPencilStrokePreview or CanvasMarkerStrokePreview with first point
  Preview-->>Runtime: preview revision fact
  Runtime->>Signals: publish CanvasRuntimeState with updated state.revisions.preview
  Preview->>Frame: request overlay repaint only
  Frame->>Preview: capture previewRevision and stroke preview once
  Frame->>Frame: build immutable stroke overlay primitive
  Frame->>Signals: publish overlay repaint request
  Signals-->>Surface: repaint overlay stroke preview

  loop pointer move samples for same token
    User->>Surface: pointer move
    Surface->>Tools: handlePointer(CanvasPointerSample move)
    Tools->>IE: normalized finite move sample
    IE->>IE: append normalized point and trim/resample if interactive stroke soft limit is exceeded
    Note over IE,Frame: Pencil and marker preview is overlay-only, no selected-move main-scene preview delta is staged.
    IE->>Preview: replace immutable CanvasStrokePreview concrete variant
    Preview-->>Runtime: preview revision fact
    Runtime->>Signals: publish CanvasRuntimeState with updated state.revisions.preview
    Preview->>Frame: request overlay repaint only
    Frame->>Preview: capture previewRevision and CanvasStrokePreview.points once
    Frame->>Frame: build immutable stroke overlay primitive
    Frame->>Signals: publish overlay repaint request
    Signals-->>Surface: repaint overlay stroke preview
  end

  alt stale non-terminal sample
    Surface->>Tools: handlePointer(CanvasPointerSample move)
    Tools->>IE: stale pointer token
    IE-->>Tools: ignore without preview, edit, repaint, or action
  else same-token terminal sample is invalid
    User->>Surface: pointer up or cancel
    Surface->>Tools: handlePointer(CanvasPointerSample terminal)
    Tools->>IE: same-token terminal cleanup sample
    IE->>Preview: publish CanvasNoPreview and clear stroke session
    IE->>Preview: bump previewRevision for cleared active preview
    Preview-->>Runtime: preview cleanup revision fact
    Runtime->>Signals: publish CanvasRuntimeState with updated state.revisions.preview
    Preview->>Frame: request overlay repaint cleanup
    Frame->>Signals: publish overlay cleanup repaint request
    Signals-->>Surface: repaint overlay without stroke preview
    Note over EK,Events: No EditKernel commit, Store mutation, spatial update, projection eviction, main repaint, or action event.
  else same-token pointer up
    User->>Surface: pointer up
    Surface->>Tools: handlePointer(CanvasPointerSample up)
    Tools->>IE: same-token terminal sample
    IE->>IE: append finite terminal point if distinct
    IE->>IE: normalize, cap, and resample final points to max stroke points per element

    alt final stroke has no paintable points
      IE->>Preview: publish CanvasNoPreview and clear stroke session
      IE->>Preview: bump previewRevision for cleared active preview
      Preview-->>Runtime: preview cleanup revision fact
      Runtime->>Signals: publish CanvasRuntimeState with updated state.revisions.preview
      Preview->>Frame: request overlay repaint cleanup
      Frame->>Signals: publish overlay cleanup repaint request
      Signals-->>Surface: repaint overlay without stroke preview
      Note over Touched,Signals: No touched set, commit plan, committed document revision change, spatial change, projection eviction, main repaint, or draw action is published.
    else final stroke is accepted
      IE->>EK: open synchronous interaction edit
      EK->>EK: reject disposed or nested edit
      EK->>Store: read committed revision snapshot
      Store-->>EK: committed tables and revision
      EK->>Draft: create rollback-safe draft
      IE->>EK: provide add-stroke mutation request and draw action descriptor
      EK->>Draft: add CanvasStrokeElement with generated element id
      Note over EK,Draft: Stroke uses final normalized points, color, thickness, and pencil opacity 1.0 or markerOpacity.
      Draft->>Touched: record addedElementIds containing new stroke id
      Note over Touched: Exact committed scope: new id, document, structural, bounds, visual, and projection revisions.
      EK->>Events: stage deferred draw action descriptor
      Note over Events: Not public yet. Deferred type is drawPencil or drawMarker with CanvasDrawStrokeActionPayload(tool, color, thickness, opacity, pointCount).
      EK->>EK: reject Future result before success path
      EK->>CC: compile exact add-stroke touched set and invalidation
      Touched-->>CC: added id and revision facts
      alt commit preflight and install succeed
        CC->>Store: preflight invariants
        Store-->>CC: preflight accepted
        CC->>Effects: prepare typed main RepaintIntent
        CC->>Events: attach staged draw action to commit
        CC->>Applier: hand off compiled CommitPlan
        Applier->>Store: install compiled CommitPlan atomically
        Store->>Store: replace layer membership, registry, stroke row, and revision state
        Note over Applier,Store: Atomic install is the commit boundary, InteractionEngine never mutates Store directly.
        Store-->>Applier: committed revision facts
        Applier->>Spatial: apply touched-id spatial add for new stroke id
        Spatial-->>Applier: spatial index updated for new paint and hit bounds
        Applier->>Projection: evict public document projection by projectionRevision
        Applier->>Events: materialize CanvasActionCommitted drawPencil or drawMarker after install
        Applier->>Frame: publish committed main repaint bus
        EK->>EK: close edit session and stale handle
        EK-->>IE: edit result
        IE->>Preview: publish CanvasNoPreview and clear stroke session
        IE->>Preview: bump previewRevision for cleared active preview
        Preview->>Frame: request overlay repaint cleanup
        Preview-->>Runtime: preview cleanup revision fact
        Applier-->>Runtime: committed document facts
        Runtime->>Signals: publish CanvasRuntimeState after document and preview effects
        Events->>Signals: publish draw action notification
        Frame->>Signals: publish committed main repaint and overlay cleanup repaint notifications
        Signals-->>Surface: repaint main scene with committed stroke and overlay without preview
        IE-->>Tools: terminal handling complete
      else edit exception, rejected Future, or preflight failure
        EK->>Events: discard pending draw action
        EK->>EK: rollback draft and close session
        EK-->>IE: terminal failure
        IE->>Preview: publish CanvasNoPreview and clear stroke session
        IE->>Preview: bump previewRevision for cleared active preview
        Preview-->>Runtime: preview cleanup revision fact
        Runtime->>Signals: publish CanvasRuntimeState with updated state.revisions.preview
        Preview->>Frame: request overlay repaint cleanup
        Frame->>Signals: publish overlay cleanup repaint request
        Signals-->>Surface: repaint overlay without stroke preview
        Note over Store,Signals: Rollback keeps committed document revisions, spatial index, projection cache, main repaint, and draw actions unchanged.
        Note over Runtime,Signals: Active preview cleanup publishes only preview state.
      end
    end
  end
